{"id":365,"name":"walrein","speciesId":365,"dex":365,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["ice","water"],"stats":{"hp":110,"attack":80,"defense":90,"special-attack":95,"special-defense":90,"speed":65},"abilities":[{"name":"thick-fat","hidden":false},{"name":"ice-body","hidden":false},{"name":"oblivious","hidden":true}],"height":14,"weight":1506,"baseExp":239,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/365.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/365.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/365.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/365.ogg","genus":"Ice Break Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Quebra-Gelo","flavor":[{"version":"leafgreen","text":"It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber."},{"version":"ruby","text":"WALREIN’s two massively developed tusks can totally shatter blocks of ice weighing ten tons with one blow. This POKéMON’s thick coat of blubber insulates it from subzero temperatures."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"WALREIN swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly."},{"version":"emerald","text":"To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Not only does its thick blubber keep it warm, it also protects it from attacks. It shatters ice with its prized tusks.